  "description": "In House Hessen, the most prestigious ducal family in the empire, The third son, Ercian, has a terrible temper, but the taste of his vital energy is sweeter than anything else. Maud, a succubus, infiltrated his annex disguised as a maid and secretly stole a little of his vital energy every night to feed herself, until… \n\n“How do you plan to take responsibility for defiling my body?” \n\n“Responsibility? Young Master, were you still a virgin until then?”\n\nIs a walking cake demanding that I take responsibility?\n\n**Original Webtoon:**     \n[Ridibooks](https://ridibooks.com/books/3498026579)",
